SUMMARY:Sunset Salsa Rooftop Party
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a spectacular afternoon dancing salsa\, bachata\, and more on the rooftop of the Costa Resort on Hollywood Beach. Party and dancing to the sunset. Come have a drink\, dinner and dance at the beautiful Sunset Club Bar & Lounge.\nDJ Franky Flow in the mix.\n3pm – 8:00pm\nFREE ADMISSION\n$15 valet parking fee (with validation)\nStreet Parking rate $4/hr\nSunset Club Bar & Lounge\nat Costa Resort\n777 N. Ocean Dr\nHollywood\, FL 33019\nAdditional Parking info:\n1. Margaritaville Resort Parking\n357 Johnson St\, Hollywood\, FL 33019\n– self parking: $30\n– valet parking $39\n2. Hollywood Beach Parking Lots at:\n– 359 Harrison St\, Hollywood\, FL 33019\n– 301 Indiana St\, Hollywood\, FL 33019\n– 1200 N Ocean Dr\, Hwd\, FL 33019\n– 330 Hayes St\, Hollywood\, FL 33019\n– 398 Garfield St\, Hollywood\, FL 33019\n– 300 Connecticut St\, Hwd\, FL 33019\n– 327 Nebraska St\, Hwd\, FL 33019\nWARNING: Some of these parking areas are privately run\, some are run by the city. You CANNOT be late on your parking fee or you risk getting booted\, towed or a ticket.
URL:https://golatindance.com/event/sunset-salsa-party/2026-06-21/
LOCATION:Sunset Club Rooftop Bar and Lounge\, 777 N Ocean Dr\, Hollywood\, FL\, 33019\, United States
CATEGORIES:Miami
END:VEVENT
