SUMMARY:Bachata in North Beach
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our newest monthly party\, happening every 3rd Sunday!\nWelcome to our new home at FAME!\n\n\nJoin us for our newest monthly bachata party\, happening every 3rd Sunday!Welcome to our new home at FAME\, featuring a big beautiful venue and amazing dance floor. Opening night January 18th MLK WEEKEND no work Monday! \n  \n🎶 Mainly Bachata with hints of SalsaThe perfect way to end your weekend dancing with us.This a monthly gathering designed for people who want to connect\, move\, and enjoy Latin music—no dance experience required. \nThis isn’t about performance or perfection. It’s about community\, good vibes\, and feeling comfortable stepping onto the dance floor for the first time. \n–Beginner-friendly lessons–Drink specials–Social dancing & special performances \n  \n🕕 6:00 PM – Salsa Class \n🕖 7:00 PM – Bachata Class \n🕗 8:00–11:00 PM – Social Dancing \n🎧 DJ Ron bringing the vibes all night \n📍 FAME – North Beach \n  \nWhat to Expect:\n• Beginner-friendly Salsa & Bachata lessons\n• A relaxed\, social atmosphere (no pressure\, no judgment)\n• Time to dance\, mingle\, and enjoy the music\n• No partner needed — come solo or with friends \nThe Vibe:\nThink Latin lounge meets social club—welcoming\, stylish\, and easygoing. \n  \n🔗 More info: www.inessencedance.com \n📲 Follow us: @inessencedanceco \nCome dance\, vibe\, and make Sunday nights unforgettable! ✨
URL:https://golatindance.com/event/bachata-in-north-beach/2026-06-21/
LOCATION:443 Broadway\, 443 Broadway\, San Francisco\, CA 94133\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94133\, US
CATEGORIES:San Francisco
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golatindance.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/295147_image.jpg
END:VEVENT
